---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="RunFps terms of service — by using this site you agree to these terms.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-6">
    <div>
      <h1 class="font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink dark:text-dark-ink tracking-tight">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray mt-1">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    </div>

    <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">By using RunFps, you agree to the following terms. If you do not agree, please do not use this site.</p>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">No Guarantee of Accuracy</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">All FPS estimates are approximate. Actual performance varies by system configuration, drivers, and other factors. These estimates should not be the sole basis for purchasing decisions.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">Use at Your Own Risk</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">This site is provided "as is" without any warranty. We are not liable for decisions made based on this data.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">Trademarks</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">All game and hardware names are trademarks of their respective owners. RunFps is not affiliated with any game publisher or hardware manufacturer.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">Affiliate Disclosure</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">As an Amazon Associate, we earn from qualifying purchases. Affiliate links may appear on this site at no extra cost to you.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">Changes</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">We may update these terms. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-ink dark:text-dark-ink mb-1">Contact</p>
      <p class="text-sm text-mid-gray dark:text-dark-mid-gray leading-relaxed">Questions, feedback, or found a bug? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@runfps.com" class="text-ink dark:text-dark-ink underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-ember transition-colors duration-120">hello@runfps.com</a>. We read every message.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
